  "releaseNotes": "0.3.6: Fix adaptive stopOnEntry incorrectly gated on GLOBAL breakpoint count — a stale breakpoint left in another virtual source (e.g. a prior ExecuteInline with a different name) silently disarmed stopOnEntry for the current file, letting the script run to completion with no pause. Now compares BreakpointCountFor(label): only breakpoints on the currently-executing file count toward the disarm decision.",
